flowchart TB
  EDA[Event-Driven Architecture SAGA]
  EDA --> DE[Domain Events]
  DE --> IMM[Immutable Records]
  DE --> PAST[Past-Tense Naming]
  DE --> PAY[Event Payload]
  PAY --> ID[Unique ID]
  PAY --> TS[Timestamp]
  PAY --> CID[Correlation ID]

  EDA --> ES[Event Sourcing]
  ES --> ESTORE[Event Store]
  ESTORE --> JDBC[JDBC Store]
  ESTORE --> MONGO[MongoDB Store]
  ESTORE --> EVDB[EventStoreDB]
  ES --> AGG[Aggregate Reconstruction]
  AGG --> SNAP[Snapshots]
  AGG --> REPLAY[Event Replay]

  EDA --> CQRS[CQRS Pattern]
  CQRS --> WRITE[Write Model / Commands]
  CQRS --> READ[Read Model / Queries]
  CQRS --> MV[Materialized Views]
  CQRS --> EC[Eventual Consistency]

  EDA --> SAGA[Saga Pattern]
  SAGA --> CHOR[Choreography]
  CHOR --> EV[Domain Events]
  CHOR --> CE[Compensating Events]
  SAGA --> ORCH[Orchestration]
  ORCH --> CO[Coordinator]
  ORCH --> SM[State Machine]

  EDA --> AXON[Axon Framework]
  AXON --> AGGREGATE[Aggregate]
  AXON --> COMMAND[Command Handler]
  AXON --> EVEV[Event Handler]
  AXON --> SAGA2[Saga Manager]

  EDA --> FAIL[Failure Handling]
  FAIL --> COMP[Compensating Transactions]
  COMP --> FW[Forward Recovery]
  COMP --> BW[Backward Recovery]
  FAIL --> RETRY[Retry Strategies]
  FAIL --> DEAD[Deadline Management]
